{"id":"en_a-fake-magistrate-saves-the-throne","title":"A Fake Magistrate Saves the Throne","titleEn":"A Fake Magistrate Saves the Throne","description":"Empress Ye Qingyao finds herself the target of staged rescues and assassination attempts orchestrated by General Gu Sinan, all designed to push her off the throne. After she escapes, a scholar named Wang Fugui comes to her aid, and the two end up trapped in Lian'an County, where she must pose as a magistrate. As hired killers close in and infiltrate their ranks, they have to find a way to outmaneuver Gu Sinan—especially once his own deputy begins to waver in his loyalty.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/a-fake-magistrate-saves-the-throne/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/a-fake-magistrate-saves-the-throne/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Historical Romance","Plot Twist","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsaza/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_a-fake-magistrate-saves-the-throne_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsaza/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-fake-magistrate-saves-the-throne_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsaza/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-fake-magistrate-saves-the-throne_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsaza/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-fake-magistrate-saves-the-throne_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"